et again  her mind was plagued with images of a  tall tower and a bolt of lightning  on the night of his death dumbledore was  struck with the green bolt of the  killing curse which matched trelawney's  prediction entirely while the exact time  and location was likely to move  dumbledore himself would eventually ask  snape to kill him to further their cause  and help bring them one step closer to  defeating voldemort when we look back at  the life and predictions of professor  trelawny it's certainly tough to make  sense of it all  just like her critics you might be  tempted to point to all the wild claims  the diviner has made through the years  and used that as evidence of her lack of  skills  and i'm not sure many people would blame  you for it  if it weren't for her otherworldly  premonition while sitting with albus  dumbledore and hogsmeade nobody in the  wizarding world would have ever taken  her seriously but even though that  prophecy and a few others would  eventually come true trelloni's own  penchant for ambiguous visions and  seemingly flat out wrong predictions  would always stain her reputation and  that's it for this video if you enjoy  the content please like the video and  subscribe to the channel  until next time remember  it does not do to dwell on dreams and  forget to live  you

